24T14:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-iran-s-medicine-supply-chain-is-failing/a-80035268--b9206162e8f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-iran-s-medicine-supply-chain-is-failing/a-80035268?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pharmacies in Iran are closing, hospital deliveries have stalled and patients are rationing doses or turning to black markets.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Is North Korea holding back on sending Russia more troops?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b20e81a885b0a535b8f368220088a891d082a557fca77c114ec13a864a85ccb4</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:42:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T12:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-north-korea-holding-back-on-sending-russia-more-troops/a-80033025--db490ffc00f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-north-korea-holding-back-on-sending-russia-more-troops/a-80033025?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A North Korean troop buildup Ukraine warned about months ago has yet to materialize, even as strategic cooperation continues. Analysts say Pyongyang is balancing its ties with Moscow and Beijing.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How cautious investors are struggling to avoid the AI bubble</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3675e7e3f0207fb11d4466dbcd5ac814dab48129526e1916c189d475d275d39</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:42:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T10:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-cautious-investors-are-struggling-to-avoid-the-ai-bubble/a-80016412--863307befc9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-cautious-investors-are-struggling-to-avoid-the-ai-bubble/a-80016412?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From Nvidia to Coreweave, AI and tech stocks have swung sharply in recent 